  "description": "A thousand years ago, during the Holy Demon War that engulfed Earth, an angel asked the barbarian Wolfgang to become its pawn and exterminate the demon race.\n\nPromised that his fallen tribe would be brought back to life if he succeeded, Wolfgang set out alone to defeat the demons.\n\nHowever, he was unexpectedly turned to stone by an ancient spell—and only awakens a thousand years later.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=852565), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14437658)",
